            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a model in this unit makes an attack, that attack has the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability if this unit is below its Starting Strength, or the [SUSTAINED HITS 2] ability if this unit is Below Half-strength.</characteristic>
