          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this model is selected to fight, you can select one enemy unit within Engagement Range  of it and roll one D6, adding 2 to the result if this model made a Charge move this turn: on a 4-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 6+, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
