          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly Adeptus Astartes unit is within 6&quot; of this model, you can re-roll Battle-shock and Leadership tests taken for that unit</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Miraculous Savior" id="9c8e-d8c0-5604-60f0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, at the end of your opponent’s Charge phase, if this model is still in Reserves, you can select one enemy unit  that made a Charge move this phase. Set this model up on the battlefield within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
