          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle round, when you select a unit from your army to use a Stratagem, if that unit is within 6&quot; of this model, you can reduce the CP cost of that Stratagem by 1CP.</characteristic>
